[Desktop Entry]
# Textdateien per Doppelklick: eigenes, schlichtes VS-Code-Fenster (nicht in ein offenes Projekt). Rückweg: docs/THEMING.md „Bedienung & Verhalten“
Type=Application
Name=VS Code (Text)
Comment=Datei in einem eigenen VS-Code-Fenster öffnen
Exec=/usr/share/code/code --new-window %F
Icon=vscode
Terminal=false
NoDisplay=true
StartupWMClass=Code
Categories=Utility;TextEditor;
MimeType=text/plain;text/markdown;text/x-log;text/x-shellscript;application/x-shellscript;application/json;application/x-yaml;application/yaml;text/x-python;application/toml;text/x-csrc;text/x-c++src;text/x-chdr;text/css;text/csv;text/x-ini;application/x-desktop;application/xml;text/xml;text/x-readme;application/javascript;text/javascript;application/x-typescript;text/x-qml;text/x-patch;text/x-diff;
